#X msg 700 8300 >>> press GO to run step 22 of 25;
#X obj 240 8370 s \$0-say;
#X obj 20 8460 select 23;
#X obj 240 8460 t b b b;
#X msg 700 8460 === STEP-23-of-25 === Panic -- the surface goes back to the device;
#X msg 700 8510 PASS IF: The Launchpad visibly leaves Programmer Mode and its own display returns. Button presses stop reaching the OLED. Watch both. It stays handed back until the patch is reloaded -- so every remaining step is downstream of this one and nothing after it can check the grid. If you have any doubt about an earlier step go back and redo it before pressing GO here.;
#X msg 700 8560 >>> press GO to run step 23 of 25;
#X obj 240 8630 s \$0-say;
#X obj 20 8720 select 24;
#X obj 240 8720 t b b b;
